# Vampires Bot Project Structure

This is a Telegram bot built with aiogram 3.x for managing political districts and actions.

## Core Architecture

- **Main Entry Point**: [app.py](mdc:app.py) - Bot application startup and configuration
- **Configuration**: [config.py](mdc:config.py) - Application configuration management
- **Database Config**: [db/config.py](mdc:db/config.py) - Database connection configuration
- **Database Session**: [db/session.py](mdc:db/session.py) - SQLAlchemy session management
- **Database Models**: [db/models.py](mdc:db/models.py) - All database models and relationships

## Key Directories

- `routes/` - Bot command handlers and routing
  - [start.py](mdc:routes/start.py) - Start command and main menu
  - [options.py](mdc:routes/options.py) - Options and settings
  - [universal.py](mdc:routes/universal.py) - Universal handlers
  - [start_support.py](mdc:routes/start_support.py) - Support functionality

- `middlewares/` - Middleware components
  - [timing.py](mdc:middlewares/timing.py) - Request timing middleware
  - [user_registration.py](mdc:middlewares/user_registration.py) - User registration middleware

- `screens/` - UI screen components and templates
