## Database Models

The bot uses SQLAlchemy with the following main models:
- `User` - User information and registration with game stats
- `District` - Political districts
- `Action` - Political actions and activities with ideology shifts
- `Politician` - Politician data
- `News` - News articles
- `UserScoutsDistrict` - User-district scouting relationships

